label route_jiho_trip:

    scene bg school at bg_fit with dissolve

    show jihoquiet at right_char with dissolve
    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Day two. Ji-ho found me after breakfast. He didn't usually find people."

    jiho "Walk with me."
    soo "Okay."

    jiho "You said I don't have to wait for everything."
    soo "Yeah."
    jiho "I've been waiting for certainty before I do anything. But nothing is ever certain."
    jiho "My parents mapped out every decision. I grew up thinking that was how you avoided mistakes."
    soo "But you miss things."
    jiho "I miss things."
    soo "Then stop waiting."
    jiho "It's not that simple."
    soo "I know."
    jiho "You're different from what I expected."
    soo "What did you expect?"
    jiho "Someone easier to ignore."

    thought "He started walking again. I walked beside him. I didn't think about going home."

    $ add_observation("Ji-ho", "He said he waits for certainty and misses things. Said I'm harder to ignore than expected.")

    hide jihoquiet
    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene black with dissolve

    show jihoquiet at right_char with dissolve
    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Last evening. He found me on the overlook and held out the sketchbook."
    thought "Two figures. Side by side. Looking at the same thing. I couldn't see their faces. But I knew."

    soo "You drew us."
    jiho "I drew what was there."
    soo "This is the first time you haven't waited."
    jiho "Yes."
    soo "How does it feel?"
    jiho "Uncertain. But less like missing something."

    thought "Our fingers overlapped when I handed it back. Neither of us moved."
    thought "We just stood there. Looking at the same view. Not saying anything."

    $ add_observation("Ji-ho", "He drew us side by side. Said uncertain but less like missing something.")

    hide jihoquiet
    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene black with dissolve
    jump final_chapter


label route_chunyeon_trip:

    scene bg school at bg_fit with dissolve

    show chunyeon at right_char with dissolve
    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Day two. Same spot. Same stillness."

    soo "You're back."
    chunyeon "So are you."
    chunyeon "Why do you look at me like you're waiting for something to shift?"
    soo "Because I am. I want to see what's underneath."
    chunyeon "What if it's ordinary?"
    soo "Then it's ordinary. That's not a bad thing."
    chunyeon "Ordinary means replaceable."
    soo "That's not how people work. Ordinary means real."
    soo "And real is harder to find than you think."
    chunyeon "I don't know what to do with that."
    soo "You don't have to do anything. Just let it be true."

    thought "He looked back at the lake. Less composed. Like he'd put something down."

    $ add_observation("Chun-young", "He asked if ordinary means replaceable. I said ordinary means real.")

    hide chunyeon
    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene black with dissolve

    show chunyeon at right_char with dissolve
    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Last evening. He found me before dinner. He was changing the arrangement."

    chunyeon "I've spent a long time being extraordinary. Or performing it. I'm not sure which."
    soo "Does it matter?"
    chunyeon "If it was performance — I don't know who I am without it."
    soo "Then find out."
    chunyeon "What if I don't like what I find?"
    soo "Then you'll know. Knowing is better than performing."
    chunyeon "Stay. Just for a minute."

    thought "I stayed. The light changed. Something settled."
    thought "Like he'd decided something. Not out loud. Just decided."

    $ add_observation("Chun-young", "He asked me to just stay. Something settled.")

    hide chunyeon
    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene black with dissolve
    jump final_chapter


label route_eunhyeong_trip:

    scene bg school at bg_fit with dissolve

    show eunhyeong at right_char with dissolve
    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Day two. Found him early, before anyone was up. Less assembled than usual."

    soo "You're up early."
    eunhyeong "It's the only time I don't have to be anything."
    soo "What are you when you're not being anything?"
    eunhyeong "Tired. Uncertain whether people would stay if I stopped making it easy."
    soo "I'm still here. And you haven't been performing for me."
    eunhyeong "No. I haven't. That's new."
    soo "Is it okay?"
    eunhyeong "Strange. But yes."

    $ add_observation("Eunhyeong", "Early morning is the only time he doesn't have to be anything. Not performing for me is new.")

    hide eunhyeong
    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene black with dissolve

    show eunhyeong at right_char with dissolve
    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Last evening. Dinner was loud. Eunhyeong held the room together like always."
    thought "Then everyone turned away and his face went quiet. Just for a second."
    thought "I caught his eye. Recognition. Later he found me outside."

    eunhyeong "You saw that."
    soo "Yeah."
    eunhyeong "Does it change anything?"
    soo "No. It just means I know."
    eunhyeong "I don't know what to do with someone who sees through it."
    soo "Just let me."
    eunhyeong "That's terrifying."
    soo "I know."
    eunhyeong "Okay."

    thought "Like a decision. Okay. Let me."

    $ add_observation("Eunhyeong", "He said okay. Like a decision.")

    hide eunhyeong
    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene black with dissolve
    jump final_chapter


label route_woo_trip:

    scene bg school at bg_fit with dissolve

    show woosmile at right_char with dissolve
    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Day two. Same rock. It felt familiar already."

    soo "You're here again."
    woo "It's a good rock."
    soo "It's a rock."
    woo "A good one."
    woo "Do you ever get tired of figuring people out?"
    soo "Sometimes. But people are worth it."
    woo "Even when they make it difficult?"
    soo "Especially then."
    woo "I make it difficult."
    soo "I know."
    woo "And you're still here. Why?"
    soo "Because you're worth it."
    woo "I don't know how to be the version of myself that doesn't perform."
    soo "Then we'll figure it out."
    woo "We?"
    soo "If you want."
    woo "Yeah. I want."

    thought "He said it quietly. Like it cost something. Like it was worth it."

    $ add_observation("Woo Ju-in", "He asked why I'm still here. I said because he's worth it. He said we.")

    hide woosmile
    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene black with dissolve

    show woosmile at right_char with dissolve
    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Last evening. Same rock. Sun going down."

    woo "Nobody's ever said they'd bother figuring me out."
    soo "Well. I'm bothering."
    woo "Yeah. I noticed."

    thought "He smiled. The real one. The one that was just for me."

    $ add_observation("Woo Ju-in", "Nobody's ever bothered. I said I'm bothering. He said yeah, I noticed.")

    hide woosmile
    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene black with dissolve
    jump final_chapter


label route_sara_trip:

    scene bg school at bg_fit with dissolve

    show sarasmilequiet at center_char with dissolve
    show sooneutralquiet at left_char with dissolve

    thought "Day two. Sara knocked on my cabin door. She always knocked, even when it was open."

    sara "Come walk with me?"
    soo "Yeah. Okay."

    thought "We walked. Neither of us spoke for a while. More comfortable than it had been in years."

    sara "What happened? Three years ago. I'd rather know."
    soo "I was scared. This world felt like a story and you felt like the center of it."
    soo "I thought if I stayed close I'd lose myself."
    sara "It makes more sense than you think."
    sara "I always felt like you were watching from somewhere I couldn't reach."
    soo "I'm sorry. I'm actually sorry."
    sara "I'm not going to say it's okay. Because it wasn't."
    sara "But I'm glad you told me."

    thought "She bumped my shoulder. I bumped back. We were still here."

    $ add_observation("Sara", "I told her I was scared of the story. She said she felt like I was watching from somewhere she couldn't reach.")

    hide sarasmilequiet
    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene black with dissolve

    show sarasmilequiet at center_char with dissolve
    show sooneutralquiet at left_char with dissolve

    thought "Last evening. Same spot. It had already become ours."

    sara "I'm glad you're here. Not just on the trip. In my life. Still."
    soo "I'm not going anywhere."
    sara "I know. That's new."
    soo "Yeah. It is."

    thought "She smiled. The real one. I was going to stop making her wait."

    $ add_observation("Sara", "She said I'm glad you're here. Still. I said I'm not going anywhere.")

    hide sarasmilequiet
    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene black with dissolve
    jump final_chapter


label final_chapter:

    scene bg class at bg_fit with dissolve

    show screen chapter_card("Final Chapter", "Presence")

    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Monday. Back to classrooms and schedules."
    thought "I'd been afraid it would feel smaller. It didn't. It felt like mine."
    thought "Ji-ho at the window. Eunhyeong making someone laugh. Chun-young reading."
    thought "Jooin watching everything and pretending not to."
    thought "Sara saving the seat right beside her. Not one over. Right beside her."
    thought "I sat down."

    hide sooneutralquiet

    show sarasmilequiet at left_char with dissolve
    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    sara "You're on time today."
    soo "Don't make it weird."
    sara "I'm making it weird."
    soo "You're making it weird."

    thought "She laughed. I laughed. It was just easy."

    hide sarasmilequiet
    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene bg school_hallway at bg_fit with dissolve

    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "After school I walked home past the cherry blossom trees."
    thought "Still in bloom. Still in March. Still impossible."
    thought "I don't know when this stopped feeling like a story."
    thought "I just know that it did. And that I'm here. And that here is enough."

    hide sooneutralquiet

    show sooneutraltalk at center_char with dissolve

    soo "Okay."

    hide sooneutraltalk

    scene black with dissolve

    "Between Panels"
    "End."

    return
